WEBVTT

01:00.960 --> 01:04.720
I heard that the phoenix fell from the west.

01:05.200 --> 01:08.800
It looks like a heavenly sign.

01:10.960 --> 01:11.680
Your Highness.

01:12.480 --> 01:13.840
Long time no see.

01:13.960 --> 01:15.440
How have you been?

01:16.800 --> 01:18.360
How are you, General?

01:19.160 --> 01:20.280
But I'm different.

01:21.000 --> 01:22.480
But a loser

01:22.920 --> 01:24.280
There's no Phoenix.

01:24.760 --> 01:26.480
Hahaha.

01:53.840 --> 01:56.920
Your Highness, you're so beautiful.

01:57.320 --> 01:59.080
and beautiful.

02:02.880 --> 02:06.160
The new and old emperors can't forget you.

02:07.040 --> 02:08.600
Now,

02:08.600 --> 02:12.080
the spies who are looking for the Empress Dowager are all over the country.

02:13.360 --> 02:14.560
Do you think

02:14.560 --> 02:16.800
Should I hand him over or not?

02:19.040 --> 02:20.920
If you hand me over,

02:21.640 --> 02:25.520
I'll treat you as a true gentleman who is loyal and patriotic.

02:26.240 --> 02:27.840
Am I

02:28.160 --> 02:29.920
loyal to the emperor and patriotism?

02:32.120 --> 02:33.920
I like that Momo.

02:34.320 --> 02:36.040
Ask her to serve my mother in her tent.

02:54.880 --> 02:57.200
Baili Jinghong has evil intentions towards you.

03:00.760 --> 03:01.800
He has ulterior motives?

03:02.880 --> 03:05.000
Tell me, why is he up to no good?

03:06.160 --> 03:08.120
He's obviously coveting you.

03:08.120 --> 03:09.000
You...

03:15.880 --> 03:16.760
Why did you stop?

03:17.079 --> 03:18.240
I have nothing to say.

03:26.840 --> 03:27.640
Huo Lingyu.

03:29.320 --> 03:30.360
I have no choice.

03:35.160 --> 03:37.880
Ji Hong Zhen ascended the throne

03:38.720 --> 03:40.079
You want to imprison me as a caged bird?

03:42.000 --> 03:43.600
If I don't want to surrender,

03:44.520 --> 03:46.079
I can only get power.

03:46.920 --> 03:48.520
The supreme power.

03:49.680 --> 03:50.880
In this world,

03:52.160 --> 03:54.800
only Baili Jinghong can help me get this power.

03:56.280 --> 03:58.040
I know he is a wolf.

03:58.960 --> 04:01.040
But I have to fight a tiger for its skin.

04:05.840 --> 04:06.640
Huo Lingyu.

04:08.080 --> 04:09.040
Do you dare?

04:09.520 --> 04:11.760
Together, we'll make a big scene.

04:11.760 --> 04:12.560
Do you dare?

04:13.800 --> 04:14.600
You...

04:15.920 --> 04:16.959
I'm asking you.

04:18.839 --> 04:19.640
How dare you?

04:20.279 --> 04:21.079
No.

04:21.079 --> 04:21.880
I dare.

04:30.840 --> 04:32.520
A wise master is not afraid of the danger of justice.

04:33.200 --> 04:34.840
Only loyal officials deserve to die.

04:38.120 --> 04:38.920
Give me five.

04:43.000 --> 04:43.800
Never betray.

05:02.840 --> 05:03.640
Junior general.

05:25.960 --> 05:28.360
We could have entrusted our lives

05:29.200 --> 05:30.880
and never betray.

05:38.280 --> 05:39.880
and return to the city.

05:49.040 --> 05:50.200
Baili Jinghong,

05:50.840 --> 05:53.320
You want to use my identity to rebel.

05:54.360 --> 05:57.040
I want to use your military power to return to the capital.

05:57.800 --> 06:00.400
It depends on who is better at it.

06:07.080 --> 06:08.080
Be careful, Your Highness.

06:14.120 --> 06:15.480
Your Highness, this way please.

06:24.880 --> 06:25.920
This way, please.

06:26.920 --> 06:28.600
General likes lotus.

06:28.600 --> 06:30.960
There happens to be a bunch of hot spring in this pond.

06:31.680 --> 06:34.520
So you asked the gardener

06:34.760 --> 06:36.600
to adjust the water temperature.

06:36.800 --> 06:39.280
It can make lotus bloom until winter.

06:40.280 --> 06:41.600
Your Highness is a distinguished guest.

06:41.840 --> 06:43.320
General has ordered

06:43.320 --> 06:45.840
to let you stay in the Lotus Garden.

06:46.760 --> 06:49.800
You can come to the lotus rowing boat if you're free.

06:49.800 --> 06:51.480
This place is quiet too.

06:52.560 --> 06:55.159
No one will disturb you.

06:57.120 --> 06:58.120
Okay.

06:58.720 --> 06:59.720
Where is your young general?

07:00.280 --> 07:01.280
Junior general.

07:02.280 --> 07:03.280
I don't know.

07:03.880 --> 07:04.880
Excuse me.

07:13.120 --> 07:14.800
We failed to find the ledger.

07:15.480 --> 07:17.920
There is false news from Mount Beili.

07:17.920 --> 07:19.600
Two crimes shall be punished together.

07:20.000 --> 07:21.880
As usual, Nine-head.

07:22.400 --> 07:24.360
I’ll forgive you

07:24.360 --> 07:26.040
I will forgive you.

07:31.880 --> 07:33.080
He Lian Jin.

07:33.560 --> 07:35.480
Who are you?

07:36.360 --> 07:37.200
Shim Lian.

07:37.680 --> 07:38.720
The Helian Clan

07:39.400 --> 07:41.080
or Baili Jinghong?

08:34.080 --> 08:36.559
I borrowed some white snow

08:37.200 --> 08:39.679
I borrowed it from her.

08:40.919 --> 08:43.720
Is my godson pretty?

08:58.240 --> 08:59.240
Yes.

09:50.760 --> 09:52.160
Hahaha.

09:53.080 --> 09:53.960
Nine-head.

09:54.480 --> 09:56.880
You’re still so brave.

09:59.320 --> 10:01.400
General, what about these warriors?

10:04.920 --> 10:07.280
I'm happy today.

10:08.160 --> 10:09.280
Don't kill him.

10:09.680 --> 10:10.480
Keep it.

10:10.480 --> 10:11.080
Yes.

10:12.200 --> 10:13.480
General, a military report.

10:41.920 --> 10:43.920
What did Baili Jinghong do to him

10:44.800 --> 10:46.880
to make him so controlled?

10:47.640 --> 10:48.720
Maybe

10:49.160 --> 10:50.840
can really be used by me.

10:54.960 --> 10:57.000
Junior general, are you alright?

10:58.120 --> 10:59.240
I'm fine.

10:59.680 --> 11:00.960
Give them the medicine.

11:00.960 --> 11:02.800
Thank you for taking care of them.

11:02.800 --> 11:04.160
My life is yours.

11:04.160 --> 11:05.920
This is nothing.

11:08.520 --> 11:09.760
The general is getting more and more cruel.

11:10.440 --> 11:13.200
You earned all these military merits.

11:13.880 --> 11:16.120
but he's making fun of you.

11:17.920 --> 11:19.360
When?

11:19.600 --> 11:21.320
as long as you can be our general.

11:21.600 --> 11:22.960
Go apply medicine on them.

11:23.480 --> 11:24.280
Yes.

11:44.000 --> 11:46.120
I told you not to leave the bandits' den.

11:46.640 --> 11:47.320
but you wouldn't listen.

11:47.720 --> 11:49.200
When Moo-yeol met you on the North Gorge Mountain,

11:49.400 --> 11:51.040
There's nothing he wouldn't tell you.

11:52.280 --> 11:53.920
We sent fake news so frequently.

11:54.440 --> 11:55.320
I knew it.

11:55.320 --> 11:57.080
You will be punished as soon as you come back.

11:57.440 --> 11:58.760
You haven't recovered from your previous injury.

11:59.160 --> 12:00.840
Now there's a new wound.

12:08.360 --> 12:09.680
I'll get a doctor.

12:10.200 --> 12:11.040
I'm fine.

12:14.040 --> 12:15.600
Have you

12:15.600 --> 12:16.680
to see General Shen?

12:17.040 --> 12:17.840
Yes.

12:18.280 --> 12:19.760
But it's not good.

12:20.720 --> 12:23.120
The doctor said General Shen is dying.

12:23.960 --> 12:25.560
There's not much time left.

12:28.280 --> 12:29.560
Looks like we need to know

12:29.880 --> 12:31.440
what he did to her

12:32.040 --> 12:33.280
to find a solution.

12:45.680 --> 12:46.640
Good.

13:27.040 --> 13:27.840
Soldiers.

13:28.880 --> 13:30.360
Let's drink.

13:37.920 --> 13:39.080
Her Highness is here.

13:39.920 --> 13:41.640
You bastards!

13:41.640 --> 13:44.640
You don't even bow and kneel when you see Her Highness.

13:45.320 --> 13:47.920
Your Highness.

13:48.160 --> 13:49.160
It doesn't matter.

13:50.320 --> 13:52.120
Please step back.

13:53.600 --> 13:54.760
Why?

13:55.560 --> 13:57.160
Let's eat.

13:57.160 --> 13:58.400
Be generous.

13:59.000 --> 14:01.560
You should get used to it.

14:02.200 --> 14:03.240
Fine.

14:03.240 --> 14:07.360
Let's talk about the Royal Seal.

14:10.280 --> 14:12.280
General, I've asked around.

14:12.280 --> 14:14.160
The royal seal was indeed lost.

14:14.680 --> 14:15.640
What?

14:18.720 --> 14:20.240
Get out of here!

14:27.520 --> 14:29.120
The new emperor has ascended the throne.

14:30.200 --> 14:31.560
It's justifiable.

14:32.000 --> 14:33.440
No one in the court

14:34.280 --> 14:35.800
no one ever heard

14:36.480 --> 14:38.320
the late emperor had another will.

14:39.760 --> 14:41.160
I know

14:41.760 --> 14:43.040
I know.

14:44.000 --> 14:46.600
the border will send troops to the capital.

14:46.600 --> 14:47.760
is a taboo.

14:48.880 --> 14:50.280
If you are not careful,

14:50.280 --> 14:53.440
you'll be accused of treason.

14:59.320 --> 15:02.720
Do you think you caught me?

15:05.920 --> 15:06.720
No.

15:07.480 --> 15:09.400
I chose you.

15:11.120 --> 15:12.960
Because I chose you.

15:13.240 --> 15:15.200
That's why I'm standing by your side now.

15:16.200 --> 15:17.160
and slander you for treason.

15:18.520 --> 15:19.600
Baili Jinghong,

15:20.680 --> 15:22.680
Are you afraid?

15:32.480 --> 15:33.680
The new emperor loves me.

15:34.880 --> 15:36.240
He's crazy.

15:36.920 --> 15:38.800
If I want wealth and power,

15:39.120 --> 15:40.440
I'll have everything.

15:41.680 --> 15:43.840
Why do you think I want to escape from the palace?

15:54.560 --> 15:56.840
Hahaha.

15:57.800 --> 16:00.720
You've got guts.

16:09.240 --> 16:10.040
Demon Queen, stop!

16:12.240 --> 16:14.520
You're so arrogant.

16:14.800 --> 16:16.440
I thought she was so noble.

16:17.360 --> 16:19.720
But she's a bitch who tried to seduce our general.

16:20.080 --> 16:21.920
She is indeed a shameless demon queen.

16:22.600 --> 16:24.080
Now you're bringing it up again.

16:26.200 --> 16:27.240
What did you say?

16:28.920 --> 16:29.880
What are you glaring at?

16:30.600 --> 16:31.680
Am I wrong?

16:32.960 --> 16:35.280
Who knows how you became the Empress Dowager?

16:36.000 --> 16:37.920
First, the Emperor, then the Crown Prince.

16:38.320 --> 16:40.440
Now you're thinking about our general.

16:43.080 --> 16:44.520
If you say one more word,

16:45.400 --> 16:46.640
I'll pull out your tongue.

16:52.240 --> 16:53.640
Prepare water. I want to take a bath.

16:53.640 --> 16:54.440
Okay.
